# Documentation Agent Rules — VFPScanner Web

- Update co-located `AGENT.md` when folder conventions change
- Sync `docs/PLAN.md` when JSON tickets or epic status change
- Update `docs/tasks/todo.md` when a task completes
- Capture learnings in `docs/tasks/lessons.md` and `docs/learning/`
- New agent folder → create its `AGENT.md`
- Price change → update `docs/PRICING.md` and `frontend/lib/pricing.ts` together

*Documentation Agent Rules — VFPScanner Web v0.1.0*
